### 3. **Directorul `tests` și Testele Unitare**

#### **Test pentru `Player` (`tests/player_test.cpp`)**
```cpp
#include <gtest/gtest.h>
#include "../include/player.hpp"

TEST(PlayerTest, GetNameTest) {
    Player player("John");
    ASSERT_EQ(player.getName(), "John");
}

TEST(PlayerTest, MoveTest) {
    Player player("John");
    testing::internal::CaptureStdout();
    player.move();
    std::string output = testing::internal::GetCapturedStdout();
    ASSERT_EQ(output, "John is moving.\n");
}
